{"id":"wb-7-1134","name":"东生围","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东生围","text":"东生围位于中国江西省赣州市安远县镇岗乡老围村，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n东生围是最大的客家方型围屋，始建于清道光二十二年（1842年），经过3次扩建、历时25年。围屋和附属设施及外大门，共占地面积30391平方米。整个围子坐东朝西，呈“回”字形，围内共有199间房间，有九个天井十八个厅堂，俗称“九井十八厅”。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E7%94%9F%E5%9B%B4","revisionId":86856266,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86856266","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/5c4ebfbb71a654eb027ffd0a.jpg","title":"Anyuan_Dongshengwei_2018.10.07_10-03-34.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Anyuan_Dongshengwei_2018.10.07_10-03-34.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ac/Anyuan_Dongshengwei_2018.10.07_10-03-34.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"东生围","width":320,"height":240}}